- [ ] The initial workflow failure was observed.
- [ ] The failed step was inspected in the logs.
- [ ] The cause of failure was identified.
- [ ] The incorrect command was corrected.
- [ ] A new workflow run was triggered.
- [ ] All corrected steps completed successfully.
- [ ] The latest run shows a green check mark.